{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.poster.avif?t=1757490501\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.webm?t=1757490501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/dd7430053faff025c17294bc13a2ab0b.mp4?t=1757490501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Light Dude</strong> the level goes dark when you move so that every obstacle in the level gets hidden! Once you stop moving, the level reveals again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Careful!</strong> You\u2019ve only got a handful of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the level!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.poster.avif?t=1757490501\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.webm?t=1757490501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/b0b8c280e822c651292b2cbfe69cf3c1.mp4?t=1757490501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety</strong> \u2013 Chapters with different puzzles, obstacles and boss fights.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor</strong> \u2013 Lots of laughs as the game roasts you when you lose!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode</strong> \u2013 Replay Light Dude with no restarts, speed runs, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Mode\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Play in first-person mode for an extreme immersive experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/48b3d65b2f5d1d56c3d704c9418e2668.poster.avif?t=1757490501\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/48b3d65b2f5d1d56c3d704c9418e2668.webm?t=1757490501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/48b3d65b2f5d1d56c3d704c9418e2668.mp4?t=1757490501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055110?t=1757490501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/04051bbb0075fc416fad653e109be6247c67ec41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757490501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/aa54e85684f50ab4c4b13530bc5ddaa7af1fb359/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757490501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/aa54e85684f50ab4c4b13530bc5ddaa7af1fb359/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757490501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">